  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Enjoy time w/family and friends at this beautiful home in Inlet Beach, the most sought after community in Santa Rosa Beach on 30A. Relax inside with the modern yet comfortable furnishings, kick back on the 4-level front porch or relax under the covered pergola in the backyard. Enjoy the day your favorite food on the grill as you make memories around the backyard fire pit. <br>The space<br>Bedrooms: King size primary bedroom with balcony, walk-in closet luxurious spa bath with dual sinks and large glass shower. Two additional queen size bedrooms with closet storage; beautiful large hall bath with soaking tub/shower combo; washer/dryer located on the second level.<br><br>Kitchen: Fully stocked kitchen with large island and extra seating for family meals, hanging out, entertaining. Large dining table with seating for 8.<br><br>Backyard: Enjoy a nice evening with family under the large lighted pergola and sectional sofa or indulge in a nice meal on the gas grill.<br><br>Living Room: Enjoy relaxing on the comfortable sleeper sofa or watch a movie on the flat screen tv or playing board games!<br><br>TVs: Each bedroom equipped with HD flat screen Smart TVs for you to access your own paid network accounts. Owner provides YouTube TV for watching live TV channels.<br><br><br>There is also a four-story observation tower from which you can enjoy dazzling views of the Gulf of Mexico.<br>Guest access<br>Neighborhood is golf cart friendly with cart parking at pool. Golf cart rentals are available nearby. Property has parking for three vehicles. Neighborhood has strict policy against street parking. Walking trails are available for a nice moment with mother nature.<br>Other things to note<br>Enjoy the white sand beaches via multiple beach access points. There are many options for casual dining and entertainment. Destin outlets are within driving distance.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
